+page8='<section class="slide" id="sample8" hidden>'+route+'<p class="eyebrow">分配注意 / 任務切換體驗</p><h1>'+e(p8['title'])+'</h1><p class="lead">'+e(p8['main_message'])+'</p><div class="intro-grid"><div class="instructions"><h2>看數字之前，先看規則</h2><p>'+e(p8['explanation'])+'</p><p>'+e(p8['blocks'][0]['text'])+'</p></div><div class="rounds"><div class="round-card"><strong>分段輪</strong><p>先連做6題奇偶，再連做6題大小。</p></div><div class="round-card"><strong>交替輪</strong><p>每題換規則，奇偶與大小各6題。</p></div><p class="fine">'+e(p8['blocks'][2]['text'])+'</p></div></div><div class="experiment"><div class="exp-top"><span id="trial-count">練習6題 · 每輪12題</span><span id="rule" class="rule">準備好再開始</span></div><div id="stimulus" class="stimulus" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">—</div><div class="answers"><button id="answer-left" disabled><span id="left-label">左側答案</span><kbd>F</kbd></button><button id="answer-right" disabled><span id="right-label">右側答案</span><kbd>J</kbd></button></div><p id="status" class="status" aria-live="polite">先練習；說明與題間停頓不計入作答時間。</p><div class="actions"><button id="start" class="primary">開始練習</button><button id="continue" class="primary" hidden>開始這一輪</button><button id="skip">先跳過，看解讀</button></div></div><section id="results" class="results" aria-live="polite" hidden><h2>這次作答告訴你什麼？</h2><div id="result-grid" class="result-grid"></div><p id="interpret" class="interpret"></p></section><details><summary>想知道計分細節？</summary><p>兩輪各12題，排除5，匹配各規則的數字範圍與左右答案分布，先後順序隨機。每題最多5秒，時間為每題等待作答時間的加總，不含說明與題間停頓。兩輪均完整完成、無逾時、答對數相同且各至少10題，才解讀差值；這是教學門檻，不是常模。</p><p>即使安排匹配，仍不能排除練習、順序及操作的影響，一次差值不是研究效應的純估計。可跳過或重來；離頁、查看來源或切到背景會中止未完成的活動，資料只暫存於本頁記憶體，不上傳。</p></details>'+refs(p8['references'])+'</section>'
